{
  "_README": "Kenney CC0 sound-effect selection. Each rule matches file names (without extension) inside a pack and takes the first `take` in natural order. {n} is the first capture as a number, {n1} is that plus one. Footsteps, mining and engine sounds are skipped on purpose: game-only. The jingles were not auditioned; they ship as short stingers under Success.",
  "packs": [
    "interface-sounds",
    "impact-sounds",
    "ui-audio",
    "digital-audio",
    "casino-audio",
    "sci-fi-sounds",
    "music-jingles"
  ],
  "rules": [
